     3	/**
     4	 * Column fragments every Taskflow table reuses.
     5	 *
     6	 * Conventions enforced here:
     7	 *  - ids are ULID text primary keys
     8	 *  - timestamps are ISO-8601 text, not unix integers
     9	 *  - every tenant-scoped table carries `org_id`
    10	 *  - every soft-deletable table carries `archived_at`
    11	 */
    12	
